# MySQL 8 verification trigger

Touching this file (one line change) makes the `MySQL 8 report` workflow run:
it runs the MySQL suite, mirrors the quality and assets command groups from
ci.yml, and commits the transcripts to `docs/ci/mysql-8-report.md` here.

The report is committed rather than only stored in the Actions UI so the result
can be read with `git fetch` where the GitHub API is not reachable.

